	<meta name="description" content="East Central College is a two-year community college with locations in Union and Rolla, Missouri. We offer associate degrees, transfer options to four-year universities, and certificates to help you achieve your goals. Our affordable programs and supportive environment make us the perfect choice for those looking to further their education." />
