<!----------------------		FALCON MODALS			---------------------->

<style>
.blocker {
	z-index: 2001;
}
.modal {
	border-radius: 0;
	padding: 0;
	max-width: 800px;
	background-color: var(--true-blue);
	z-index: 2002;
}

.modal-col {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
}


.modal-col .modal-portrait {
	background-color: #666666;
	background-color: var(--aqua);
}
.modal-logo {
	padding: 20px;
}
.modal-logo img {
	max-width: 500px;
}

.modal-col .modal-qa {
	/* background-image: url('https://www.eastcentral.edu/images/ecc-blue-background-2024.png'); */
	background-color: var(--true-blue);
	background-position: center center;
	background-size: cover;
	padding: 40px 20px 20px;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
	.modal-col {
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
	}
	.modal-logo {
		display: none;
	}

}

.modal .modal-close {
	font-size: 30px;
	position:absolute;
	top:0;
	right:0;
	z-index: 2000;
	font-size: 48px;
	background-color: var(--sunshine);
	padding:0 10px;
	outline:none;
	opacity: 1.0;
}
.modal .modal-close:hover {
	background-color: var(--aqua);
	opacity: 1.0;
}
</style>


<div class="modal fade" id="NicolaeSmith" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="modal-title-NicolaeSmith">

	<div class="modal-col">
	
		<div class="modal-portrait">

			<div style="position: relative;">
				<img src="https://www.eastcentral.edu/images/featuredfalcon/NicolaeSmith.jpg" style="width: 100%;" alt="Nicolae Smith" loading="lazy">
				<div style="background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0), rgba(0,0,0,0.9));position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;padding: 0 10px 10px;">
					<div class="ff-name" id="modal-title-NicolaeSmith">Nicolae Smith</div>
					<div class="ff-details"><b>Hometown – Sullivan, MO</b><br>Welding</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="modal-logo">
				<img src="https://www.eastcentral.edu/images/logos/featured-falcon-logo.svg" alt="Featured Falcon logo" />
			</div>

		</div>

		<div class="modal-qa">
						<div class="ff-qa">
								<div class="ff-question">What is your dream job?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">Running a welding business.</div>
								<div class="ff-question">What advice would you give to new ECC students?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">Make sure to use the Learning Center and the resources they give you.</div>
								<div class="ff-question">What has been the most surprising thing about college life for you?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">The people. You never feel left out.</div>
								<div class="ff-question">What motivates you when things get challenging?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">Working toward the good times because there will always be challenging and bad times.</div>
								<div class="ff-question">What’s something people might be surprised to learn about you?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">I can identify basically every country by its flag.</div>
							</div>
					</div>
	</div>
		
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="TreyKulick" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="modal-title-TreyKulick">

	<div class="modal-col">
	
		<div class="modal-portrait">

			<div style="position: relative;">
				<img src="https://www.eastcentral.edu/images/featuredfalcon/TreyKulick.jpg" style="width: 100%;" alt="Trey Kulick" loading="lazy">
				<div style="background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0), rgba(0,0,0,0.9));position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;padding: 0 10px 10px;">
					<div class="ff-name" id="modal-title-TreyKulick">Trey Kulick</div>
					<div class="ff-details"><b>Hometown – Pacific, MO</b><br>Engineering</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="modal-logo">
				<img src="https://www.eastcentral.edu/images/logos/featured-falcon-logo.svg" alt="Featured Falcon logo" />
			</div>

		</div>

		<div class="modal-qa">
						<div class="ff-qa">
								<div class="ff-question">What advice would you give to new ECC students?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">Collaborate with other students as much as possible, and don’t be afraid to ask for help.</div>
								<div class="ff-question">What has been the most surprising thing about college life for you?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">The amount of effort required to get good grades.</div>
								<div class="ff-question">What motivates you when things get challenging?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">I’ve been challenged and succeeded with hard work so many times. The next time I face a difficult situation, I know I can persist.</div>
								<div class="ff-question">What’s something people might be surprised to learn about you?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">I was pretty good at football back in the day.</div>
							</div>
					</div>
	</div>
		
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="DrewGarner" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="modal-title-DrewGarner">

	<div class="modal-col">
	
		<div class="modal-portrait">

			<div style="position: relative;">
				<img src="https://www.eastcentral.edu/images/featuredfalcon/DrewGarner.jpg" style="width: 100%;" alt="Drew Garner" loading="lazy">
				<div style="background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0), rgba(0,0,0,0.9));position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;padding: 0 10px 10px;">
					<div class="ff-name" id="modal-title-DrewGarner">Drew Garner</div>
					<div class="ff-details"><b>Hometown – Sullivan, MO</b><br>Media Studies</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="modal-logo">
				<img src="https://www.eastcentral.edu/images/logos/featured-falcon-logo.svg" alt="Featured Falcon logo" />
			</div>

		</div>

		<div class="modal-qa">
						<div class="ff-qa">
								<div class="ff-question">What advice would you give to new ECC students?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">Go to as many events as possible. I have come to realize that talking to new people isn’t as hard as it may seem. Many people are just like you and would be happy if you turned to talk to them in class.</div>
								<div class="ff-question">What’s a hobby or interest you have?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">I collect vinyls from artists I enjoy. I try to find them in stores rather than purchasing them online; it feels more like a collector’s item that way.</div>
								<div class="ff-question">What would you bring to Show and Tell?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">I would bring my book full of Polaroid pictures. This book covers a full year of my life, one photo for each day.</div>
								<div class="ff-question">What is your top travel destination?</div>
				<div class="ff-answer">I would travel to New York, specifically during the wintertime. I would love to see the huge cityscape with shining billboards and snow falling all around me.</div>
							</div>
					</div>
	</div>
		
</div>

<!----------------------		/FALCON MODALS			---------------------->





<!----------------------		/FEATURED FALCON			---------------------->










